<title>UK: Exportfinans sets 7.0 bln yen dual-currency bond.</title>
<headline>Exportfinans sets 7.0 bln yen dual-currency bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint leads Salomon Brothers International and Toyo Trust International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EXPORTFINANS</p>
<p> AMT    7.0 BLN YEN   COUPON   **5.05	MATURITY    28.JAN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    28.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.50	MOODY	AA1	 S&amp;P	   AAA</p>
<p> NOTES	**REDEMPTION IS $4,310.72 PER 500,000 YEN</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
